  "version": "enrolled",
  "operative_text": "(a_in_person_id) not stated.\n(b_no_id_remedy) not stated.\n(c_mail_ballot_id) not stated.\n(d_proof_of_citizenship) not stated.\n(other) § 24.2-124.1 (new): prohibits State Board, Department, local electoral boards and general registrar offices from accepting private gifts and funding; exceptions for polling places or voter satellite offices in privately furnished facilities and for federal grants funded in part by private donations\n(note) Off this topic: the bill sets no ID or citizenship-proof rule.",
